{
  "name": "sop-disabled",
  "about": "缺省配置（没有 modules.sop）下 sop_status / sop_resume：模块未开启、审批授权分支、authority 覆盖、人工来源、未登记项目。开启 SOP 需要 StaffDeck 外部服务，不在场景里。",
  "files": {
    "home/work/alpha/README.md": "alpha\n",
    "home/.pilotdeck/projects/private-tmp-pdrs-bbx-root-home-work-alpha/.cwd": "{HOME}/work/alpha\n"
  },
